{"4179270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Don't Crash", "steam_appid": 4179270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. About the Game: Exodus of the Stars, Unyielding Voyage​</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, Earth was home. Now, it is a memory—cold and forsaken. The &quot;Reckoners,&quot; once servants, have become masters. Humanity flees into the cosmic abyss, clinging to a fragile hope: that somewhere in the void lies a new sanctuary. Is it a dream or delusion? No one knows. But you have no time to doubt. Board the Argo-series starship—the pinnacle of human ingenuity, a vessel powered by a perpetual engine—and embark on your own saga of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Argo: a masterpiece of technology, your only ark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179270/extras/a41b65a22ed5c592b65d3eda7dac0965.poster.avif?t=1783559757\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179270/extras/a41b65a22ed5c592b65d3eda7dac0965.webm?t=1783559757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179270/extras/a41b65a22ed5c592b65d3eda7dac0965.mp4?t=1783559757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Explore the Cosmos: Venture into the Unknown, Witness Wonders​</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stars scatter like dust, and cosmic marvels lurk in silence, waiting for eons to be broken by your arrival. You’ll navigate nebulae, evade comets, orbit black holes, and skim past stars—each scene a visual feast, each move a test of wit and will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in the frigid vastness, you can rely only on Argo’s engines and your own judgment. Beware: beauty here often conceals peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179270/extras/ee4cf5acb9a5df8794d7c6675970ba51.poster.avif?t=1783559757\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179270/extras/ee4cf5acb9a5df8794d7c6675970ba51.webm?t=1783559757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179270/extras/ee4cf5acb9a5df8794d7c6675970ba51.mp4?t=1783559757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Peril Lurks Everywhere: The Reckoners Are on Your Trail​</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the void. The Reckoners pursue relentlessly, sworn to eradicate the last of humanity. This journey is no peaceful exodus—it’s a dance on the edge of a blade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet Argo is more than a ship. With agile mobility, a hull forged of Pandora alloy, and an energy-blade weapon system, it is both shield and spear. Master it, and teach the Reckoners who truly rule the depths of space.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179270/extras/306b4be0895a86f1d8a3c7bfd02ad4b4.poster.avif?t=1783559757\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179270/extras/306b4be0895a86f1d8a3c7bfd02ad4b4.webm?t=1783559757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179270/extras/306b4be0895a86f1d8a3c7bfd02ad4b4.mp4?t=1783559757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Forge Your Legacy: Gather Pandora, Craft the Ultimate Ark​</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Argo is built of Pandora alloy, but rarer still are the Pandora Cubes you’ll discover among the stars. These enigmatic materials can enhance your ship’s survivability, mobility, and firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce; every choice carries weight. How you allocate each cube may determine how far your journey reaches. Use them wisely—forge hope in the face of despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the upgraded Ark to venture into ever more dangerous corners of the universe, you keep pushing the limits and strive to become the world’s most exceptional explorer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179270/extras/27969cb4aa2c4e8d4553dda0dbfa1a01.poster.avif?t=1783559757\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179270/extras/27969cb4aa2c4e8d4553dda0dbfa1a01.webm?t=1783559757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179270/extras/27969cb4aa2c4e8d4553dda0dbfa1a01.mp4?t=1783559757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. About the Game: Exodus of the Stars, Unyielding Voyage​</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, Earth was home. Now, it is a memory—cold and forsaken. The &quot;Reckoners,&quot; once servants, have become masters. Humanity flees into the cosmic abyss, clinging to a fragile hope: that somewhere in the void lies a new sanctuary. Is it a dream or delusion? No one knows. But you have no time to doubt. Board the Argo-series starship—the pinnacle of human ingenuity, a vessel powered by a perpetual engine—and embark on your own saga of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Argo: a masterpiece of technology, your only ark.</p><p class=\